CPython sre uses a compiled program with MAX_REPEAT/MIN_REPEAT and mark stack. Let me recall actual algorithm from _sre.c (3.13):

MAX_REPEAT:
```
state->ptr = ...
count = 0
...
for (;;) {
    /* zero width match protection */
    if (ctx->ptr == lastmark) {
        break;
    }
    e = SRE(match)(ctx, ctx->pattern, ctx->ptr);
    if (!e)
        break;
    if (e > 0) count++;
    ...
    if (ctx->ptr == oldptr) {
        /* zero width match */
        if (count < mincount) ... error? maybe break */
    }
    ...
    lastmark = ctx->ptr;
    if (count < maxcount) continue;
    break;
}
/* tail */
for (;;) {
    e = SRE(match)(ctx, ctx->pattern+1, ctx->ptr);
    if (e) return success;
    if (count == mincount) break;
    count--;
    ctx->ptr = stack[count].ptr;  // backtrack
    ctx->mark = stack[count].mark; ...
}
```
